@startuml
autonumber
skinparam Monochrome true
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F9F9F9

actor Buyer
participant "System" as System
participant "Database" as DB

== Search & Product Discovery ==
Buyer -> System: searches for desired product
activate System

System -> DB: queryListings(productKeyword)
activate DB
DB --> System: returns List<Listing>
deactivate DB

System --> Buyer: displays relevant listings from sellers
deactivate System

== Listing Comparison ==
Buyer -> System: compareListings(listings)
activate System

System -> DB: fetchListingsDetails(listingIDs)
activate DB
DB --> System: returns selected Listing attributes
deactivate DB

System --> Buyer: displays selected listings together for comparison
deactivate System

Buyer -> System: inspects price, description, seller info, etc.

== Selection & Validation (ALT1) ==
Buyer -> System: selects listing to purchase
activate System

System -> DB: isAvailable() [on Listing]
activate DB
DB --> System: returns availability status
deactivate DB

alt ALT1: Buyer selects an invalid or unavailable listing
    System --> Buyer: informs listing unavailable & removes from comparison
else Listing is valid and available
    System --> Buyer: proceeds to purchase/checkout flow
end
deactivate System

@enduml